Description:
 ka9q-radio - KA9Q multichannel SDR server
 ka9q-radio-airspy - Airspy device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-airspyhf - Airspy HF+ device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-bladerf - Blade RF device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-common - common files for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-control - Control program for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-ft - FT4/FT8/WSPR skimmer daemons for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-full - meta package for all components of ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-funcube - Amsat UK Funcube Dongle Pro+ device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-hackrf - Hack RF device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-hfdl - HFDL subsystem for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-horus - demodulation subsystem for horus balloon telemetry
 ka9q-radio-monitor - Multicast stream audio monitor for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-packet - AX.25/aprs subsystem for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-recordings - recording subsystem for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-rtlsdr - Generic RTL-SDR device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-rx888 - RX-888 MkII device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-siggen - Synthetic signal generator device plugin for ka9q-radio
 ka9q-radio-tools - Command-line tools for ka9q-radio
